 or maybe a dual-wielding fidget spinner Gundam.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\tEasily recreate your favourite turrets from the first game…or <strong>combine em' all</strong> into one frankenstein monstrosity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save/Load</strong> 24 loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paint &amp; Pattern</strong> customization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/8c080cd01a511fa8a5ed8973967d9b51.avif?t=1791737689\" width=779 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/f120f593f58a554d8d43a58a3e662e25.poster.avif?t=1791737689\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/f120f593f58a554d8d43a58a3e662e25.webm?t=1791737689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/f120f593f58a554d8d43a58a3e662e25.mp4?t=1791737689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/c3ca0fd313a684c97527db96d3da9cb3.poster.avif?t=1791737689\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/c3ca0fd313a684c97527db96d3da9cb3.webm?t=1791737689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/c3ca0fd313a684c97527db96d3da9cb3.mp4?t=1791737689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vide